  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The time it&nbsp;takes for the ball to fall from a height is given&nbsp;by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>The height up to which the ball bounces after the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;collision from the floor is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</m